1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,400
Walt is in the doorway in his coat and
pajamas. The lantern swings. Rosa is
frozen, the receiver at her ear.

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:11,933
Hold it away from your face, girl.
Slowly. Don't say hello. Don't say
anything.

3
00:00:12,433 --> 00:00:16,567
Through the plastic we hear it. Not a
voice. Not static. A room, waiting.

4
00:00:17,767 --> 00:00:22,033
Rule one. Never answer alone. Someone
has to be there to say stop.
